WEBVTT

00:07.040 --> 00:08.920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

00:39.960 --> 00:41.600
The only Wei's Purple Peony in the garden.

00:44.120 --> 00:46.040
It alone reigns over
all the other peonies.

00:46.960 --> 00:50.360
I think only a peony
of such peerless beauty

00:50.880 --> 00:51.920
is worthy of you, My Lady.

00:58.760 --> 01:00.200
What have you put in my hair?

01:00.280 --> 01:01.680
Slap yourself!

01:12.720 --> 01:14.520
You witless fool.

01:14.600 --> 01:15.880
My Lady is to meet Lord Lu,

01:15.960 --> 01:18.280
yet you keep going on about being "alone."

01:18.360 --> 01:19.480
You deserve those slaps.

01:20.200 --> 01:21.320
Don't be angry, My Lady.

01:21.400 --> 01:23.720
She's a clumsy speaker
who doesn't know any better.

01:28.200 --> 01:32.080
How about this twin-lotus hairpin instead?

01:32.160 --> 01:33.840
Twin blossoms are an auspicious sign.

01:34.520 --> 01:37.040
The design symbolizes "hearts as one".

01:37.120 --> 01:40.560
May you and Lord Lu be of one heart
and enjoy a lasting marriage.

03:29.240 --> 03:33.120
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

03:36.720 --> 03:39.840
ELDEST PRINCESS'S RESIDENCE

03:49.680 --> 03:51.280
At the Eldest Princess's flower banquet,

03:51.360 --> 03:54.440
you are sure to outshine every lady
and take first place.

03:54.520 --> 03:55.480
WEI RAO
OLD MADAM WEI'S FOURTH GRANDDAUGHTER

04:00.720 --> 04:02.040
Lord Lu.

04:14.600 --> 04:17.920
I hear the Duke's ailment has returned,

04:18.000 --> 04:19.600
and none of the capital's
finest physicians can cure him.

04:19.680 --> 04:20.760
LU ZHUO, HEIR TO THE DUKE OF YING

04:20.839 --> 04:23.520
I have some Dragon's
Blood Wound-Healing Powder.

04:23.600 --> 04:26.640
It's especially effective
for chronic sores that refuse to heal.

04:27.440 --> 04:30.400
The Duke fought on the battlefield
for over 40 years.

04:30.480 --> 04:33.200
My grandfather
has always admired him greatly.

04:34.040 --> 04:35.680
My family offers this medicine
with no other intent

04:36.400 --> 04:39.040
than to show our respect
for the old hero's deeds and virtue

04:39.640 --> 04:41.480
and do what little we can.

04:41.560 --> 04:44.520
I hope you won't refuse it.

04:51.600 --> 04:53.120
Jiede, take it.

04:53.200 --> 04:54.080
Yes.

04:57.240 --> 04:58.800
Please thank your grandfather for me.

04:58.880 --> 05:00.480
When he recovers, I shall come by to

05:01.120 --> 05:02.080
express my gratitude.

05:10.840 --> 05:14.640
XIE HUALOU,
GRANDDAUGHTER OF THE GRAND TUTOR

05:14.720 --> 05:18.200
They say Lord Lu is stern and aloof,
keeps everyone at a distance,

05:18.280 --> 05:20.480
and avoids women in particular.

05:20.560 --> 05:22.360
But from what I saw just now,

05:22.440 --> 05:24.600
he was quite cordial to you.

05:25.120 --> 05:26.000
Don't talk nonsense.

05:26.760 --> 05:29.240
Lord Lu is already betrothed.

05:30.320 --> 05:31.400
When it comes to family standing,

05:31.480 --> 05:33.080
your grandfather is a renowned scholar
who has served

05:33.160 --> 05:34.360
as Grand Tutor to two emperors.

05:34.440 --> 05:35.960
Your family's standing far surpasses
that of the Wei family.

05:37.160 --> 05:40.400
As for talent, you excel at music,
weiqi, calligraphy, and painting,

05:40.480 --> 05:42.240
and poetry and verse
come effortlessly to you.

05:42.840 --> 05:44.560
Yet I've never heard of any talent
from that Lady Rao.

05:45.440 --> 05:46.680
All she has is a reputation for beauty,

05:46.760 --> 05:47.400
BITAO
MAID AT EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

05:47.480 --> 05:49.880
but she is rarely seen publicly
and is always kept hidden away.

05:49.960 --> 05:51.480
Who knows whether the beauty is true?

05:51.560 --> 05:54.560
And don't get me started
on her birth mother.

05:54.640 --> 05:55.720
Her conduct and character

05:55.800 --> 05:57.360
-are the subject of endless gossip.
-Enough.

05:58.360 --> 06:00.840
Is it your place to say such things?
Let's go.

06:08.040 --> 06:11.920
Lady Wei, the other ladies are already
waiting in the reception pavilion.

06:12.840 --> 06:14.560
I'm feeling a little stifled.

06:15.280 --> 06:17.040
I'd like to walk in the garden
and clear my head.

06:18.760 --> 06:19.680
When I was little,

06:19.760 --> 06:21.720
I often came here with Grandmother
to visit the Eldest Princess.

06:21.800 --> 06:22.840
There's no need to show me the way.

06:23.720 --> 06:24.800
Please inform the Eldest Princess

06:24.880 --> 06:27.080
that I will arrive
before the banquet begins.

06:27.960 --> 06:28.920
Yes.

06:37.360 --> 06:39.560
Weren't we supposed to enjoy the view
at the waterside pavilion?

06:39.640 --> 06:41.000
Why was it changed to here?

06:41.080 --> 06:43.320
Her Highness said
Diecui Pavilion offered a commanding view,

06:43.400 --> 06:45.440
and the scenery
would be even finer from up high.

07:07.000 --> 07:07.840
Seize her.

07:11.360 --> 07:12.480
What are you doing?

07:22.040 --> 07:24.040
Who's the empty-headed beauty?

07:25.400 --> 07:27.200
Whose birth mother
is too shameful to mention?

07:28.360 --> 07:34.840
And whose conduct and character
are the subject of endless gossip?

07:35.360 --> 07:39.840
Lady Wei, my maid spoke out of turn
and offended you.

07:39.920 --> 07:42.520
But she's blunt by nature
and meant no harm.

07:42.600 --> 07:43.960
What's the rush?

07:44.480 --> 07:45.920
I haven't forgotten you.

07:46.960 --> 07:48.160
You shameless wretch.

07:48.760 --> 07:50.840
What a fine maid you've trained.

07:52.320 --> 07:53.840
Lu Zhuo has been betrothed to me
since childhood.

07:54.480 --> 07:56.440
That makes him mine.

07:57.720 --> 07:59.520
How dare you set your sights on him?

08:01.520 --> 08:02.480
Shoucheng.

08:02.560 --> 08:04.320
QI ZHONGKAI,
SECOND SON OF THE MARQUIS OF PINGXI

08:07.360 --> 08:09.320
I heard your fiancée is here today too.

08:09.400 --> 08:10.800
You're about to leave for war.

08:11.320 --> 08:12.840
Aren't you going to say goodbye to her?

08:13.640 --> 08:14.880
-Mind your own business.
-Come on.

08:15.560 --> 08:17.840
Old Madam Wei guards Lady Wei Rao
like the apple of her eye

08:17.920 --> 08:18.920
and rarely lets her leave the house.

08:19.760 --> 08:21.520
Everyone says she's a great beauty.

08:22.600 --> 08:23.720
Just how beautiful is she?

08:24.800 --> 08:26.480
Put more thought into your training.

08:26.560 --> 08:28.120
Something's happened at Diecui Pavilion!

08:30.200 --> 08:33.039
I'd sooner see anything that belongs to me

08:33.120 --> 08:37.760
ground to dust than share
even a fraction of it with anyone else.

08:39.880 --> 08:42.919
Xie Hualou, how dare you compete with me?

08:43.000 --> 08:44.680
-I didn't…
-Do you have what it takes?

09:00.280 --> 09:02.360
Lu Zhuo! What's going on?

09:03.120 --> 09:04.600
How did she just fall from up there?

09:04.680 --> 09:06.960
DIECUI PAVILION

09:08.280 --> 09:09.680
My Lady, someone else is here.

09:10.280 --> 09:11.440
What are we going to do?

09:15.800 --> 09:18.160
Jiede, guard the garden entrance.
Let no guests in or out.

09:18.840 --> 09:19.680
-Yes.
-Qi Zhongkai,

09:19.760 --> 09:20.760
please fetch the Eldest Princess yourself.

09:21.360 --> 09:22.240
All right.

09:24.440 --> 09:26.480
Lord Lu, please…

09:26.560 --> 09:27.800
Save me.

09:28.440 --> 09:30.800
Please save me.
Wei Rao is trying to kill me.

09:31.320 --> 09:32.920
DIECUI PAVILION

10:00.320 --> 10:01.840
My Lady…

10:10.280 --> 10:11.280
Don't make a sound.

10:24.000 --> 10:27.080
DIECUI PAVILION

10:30.400 --> 10:32.080
Bitao!

10:33.000 --> 10:34.480
Bitao!

10:38.760 --> 10:40.720
How vicious of you!

10:42.480 --> 10:43.600
Pingxiang!

10:43.680 --> 10:45.440
-What exactly happened here?
-Pingxiang!

10:45.520 --> 10:47.200
Why are you two ladies not at the banquet

10:47.280 --> 10:49.880
but lingering here
at the secluded Diecui Pavilion?

10:49.960 --> 10:52.160
And how did Lady Xie fall from up here?

10:52.760 --> 10:54.080
Your Highness!

10:55.440 --> 10:57.720
I happened to run into Lady Xie
in the garden just now.

10:58.320 --> 11:00.520
She warmly invited me to walk with her,

11:00.600 --> 11:02.360
then complained the sun was too harsh.

11:03.040 --> 11:04.640
So she suggested we rest in the pavilion.

11:04.720 --> 11:07.840
Out of kindness, I sent my maid back to
the carriage for some cooling balm.

11:08.440 --> 11:09.360
But then,

11:09.440 --> 11:11.080
she suddenly confessed to me that

11:11.920 --> 11:13.000
she loves Lord Lu for long

11:13.080 --> 11:15.160
and asked me to break off
my engagement to him.

11:15.840 --> 11:17.080
Embarrassed, I tried to leave,

11:17.160 --> 11:19.480
but she was on her knees and begged me

11:19.560 --> 11:21.520
to give up the engagement.

11:21.600 --> 11:23.480
I tried repeatedly to reason with her,

11:24.080 --> 11:25.320
but she turned malicious.

11:27.320 --> 11:29.560
Thankfully, my loyal maid Bitao
stepped in to protect me,

11:29.640 --> 11:32.040
and Lady Xie lost her footing
during the struggle.

11:33.160 --> 11:34.560
My poor maid.

11:34.640 --> 11:36.040
Her face…

11:41.440 --> 11:44.520
Wei Rao, you're twisting the truth
and making false accusations!

11:45.120 --> 11:46.520
You pushed me!

11:47.560 --> 11:49.640
Your Highness, Lord Lu,

11:49.720 --> 11:52.760
my personal maid Pingxiang
can testify for me.

11:53.600 --> 11:55.960
Pingxiang!

11:56.040 --> 11:57.640
-Pingxiang…
-She's unconscious.

11:57.720 --> 11:59.240
I'm afraid she can't testify for now.

12:09.840 --> 12:10.760
Lady Xie,

12:11.560 --> 12:14.480
does this gold hairpin belong to you?

12:47.040 --> 12:49.240
If my two maids hadn't been so alert,

12:49.320 --> 12:51.080
they came back halfway while feeling off,

12:51.160 --> 12:56.160
I fear I might never have seen you again,
Lord Lu.

12:56.880 --> 12:58.280
To escape blame,

12:58.360 --> 13:01.440
you've done nothing but lie
and smear my name.

13:01.960 --> 13:03.160
Have you no conscience at all?

13:08.720 --> 13:10.440
To save my maid just now,

13:11.040 --> 13:14.600
I fought to wrest the hairpin away,
which is how I got this wound.

13:15.200 --> 13:16.760
Please, think carefully.

13:16.840 --> 13:18.680
This is the Eldest Princess's residence.

13:18.760 --> 13:21.520
I have been strictly taught by
my grandmother since childhood.

13:21.600 --> 13:23.680
How could I possibly be
so vicious and reckless?

13:23.760 --> 13:25.520
And where would I find the nerve?

13:29.440 --> 13:31.360
I have been wronged for no reason.

13:32.040 --> 13:35.600
Your Highness, please see justice done!

13:36.680 --> 13:39.720
Your Highness, please clear my name!

13:41.960 --> 13:42.880
Lu Zhuo,

13:42.960 --> 13:46.440
which one of these two beauties
is telling the truth?

13:47.040 --> 13:49.600
Lord Lu, what do you think?

14:02.040 --> 14:03.960
Only the Xie and Wei families' servants
were in the pavilion.

14:04.480 --> 14:05.640
No outsider was here
to serve as a witness.

14:06.520 --> 14:08.280
Both sides now tell different stories,

14:09.040 --> 14:10.360
so even Your Highness
may find it difficult to judge.

14:12.160 --> 14:13.800
Lady Xie has clearly suffered
a terrible fright

14:13.880 --> 14:15.080
and is in quite a disheveled state.

14:15.160 --> 14:16.080
It may invite unwanted gossip.

14:17.320 --> 14:18.480
Perhaps she should remain here for now,

14:19.280 --> 14:20.520
freshen up, change her clothes,

14:21.600 --> 14:22.680
and then be escorted home.

14:23.440 --> 14:25.520
Lord Lu, that seems appropriate.

14:26.160 --> 14:28.200
Well, escort your fiancée home first.

14:34.040 --> 14:35.160
Thank you, Your Highness.

14:53.720 --> 14:56.960
ELDEST PRINCESS QINGYUAN'S RESIDENCE

15:05.800 --> 15:07.200
Recently, the Hutuo have been raiding
our northern border,

15:07.800 --> 15:09.640
leaving border families destitute
and driven from their homes.

15:10.680 --> 15:12.240
I volunteered to lead a campaign
against them,

15:13.520 --> 15:14.920
and the army will depart soon.

15:15.520 --> 15:17.960
When I return,
I'll come to your residence in person

15:24.640 --> 15:25.640
to call off the marriage,

15:29.000 --> 15:30.160
and end our engagement.

15:31.080 --> 15:32.320
You want to break off?

15:38.000 --> 15:39.840
I've seen countless corpses
on the battlefield.

15:40.800 --> 15:43.400
The cause of a blade wound
can't be twisted by mere words.

15:44.520 --> 15:47.480
Whether she attacked you first
or you wounded yourself to frame her

15:48.640 --> 15:50.360
can be determined by measuring the wound.

15:50.440 --> 15:52.240
The wounds are distinctive
in depth and shape.

15:53.080 --> 15:54.560
The railing she fell from

15:55.080 --> 15:57.120
and the way she landed
can also provide clues.

15:57.720 --> 15:59.080
Ultimately, the culprit

16:01.560 --> 16:02.680
will have nowhere to hide.

16:05.200 --> 16:06.200
I didn't do it.

16:07.320 --> 16:09.400
Why do you trust an outsider over me?

16:10.040 --> 16:11.720
Such a beautiful face.

16:13.480 --> 16:15.360
Such flawless, delicate hands.

16:16.760 --> 16:18.400
Yet the heart inside you

16:19.000 --> 16:20.720
is more venomous
than any snake or scorpion.

16:21.800 --> 16:23.280
I didn't expose you in front of everyone

16:23.800 --> 16:25.880
because I wouldn't tarnish
your family's reputation

16:27.480 --> 16:31.760
or let Uncle Wei's lifelong reputation
be ruined by his own daughter.

16:42.280 --> 16:43.320
That's right.

16:44.600 --> 16:46.320
I pushed her.

16:48.920 --> 16:53.160
Too bad fate wasn't on my side
and you happened to catch her.

16:53.240 --> 16:54.920
Back at Qiyang Pass,

16:55.000 --> 16:57.760
my father carried your father out
through a mountain of corpses,

16:58.400 --> 17:00.920
only to suffer grievous wounds himself
and bleed to death.

17:02.840 --> 17:04.240
His death left me an orphan,

17:04.319 --> 17:06.240
and now you want to break off
our engagement?

17:09.640 --> 17:11.319
In your dreams.

17:13.520 --> 17:15.200
Your family owes me.

17:17.200 --> 17:18.880
And so do you.

17:19.480 --> 17:21.599
You say I'm as venomous as a snake?

17:23.200 --> 17:24.520
How pitiful.

17:26.520 --> 17:29.280
You are destined to share a bed with one,

17:30.720 --> 17:33.720
and you'll never escape me
for as long as you live.

17:34.960 --> 17:36.600
Then just wait

17:38.920 --> 17:41.240
and see how I end this engagement.

17:43.840 --> 17:44.920
Lu Zhuo!

17:55.640 --> 17:56.960
-Make way!
-Check this out.

17:57.040 --> 17:58.400
-Clear the road!
-Sir, look at this!

17:58.480 --> 17:59.840
Move aside!

17:59.920 --> 18:01.040
You there, make way!

18:01.120 --> 18:02.680
Trinkets!

18:05.440 --> 18:06.680
Then just wait

18:07.840 --> 18:10.040
and see how I end this engagement.

18:11.080 --> 18:12.960
Come take a look!

18:16.000 --> 18:17.240
Make way!

18:17.320 --> 18:18.480
It stinks!

18:30.160 --> 18:31.600
-My goodness.
-It stinks!

18:32.640 --> 18:33.720
Are you blind?

18:33.800 --> 18:35.600
-Watch where you're going!
-I was blind and careless

18:35.680 --> 18:36.760
and offended Her Ladyship.

18:36.840 --> 18:38.360
I'll clean it up at once.

18:38.440 --> 18:39.760
Sir, don't go!

18:40.360 --> 18:41.480
What rotten luck.

18:41.560 --> 18:43.360
You fouled my lady's carriage.

18:43.440 --> 18:44.960
You deserve to be taught a lesson!

18:48.120 --> 18:50.760
-You ugly night-soil woman!
-It was my fault.

18:50.840 --> 18:51.760
Please have mercy.

18:51.840 --> 18:54.440
It was my fault. Please have mercy.

18:57.480 --> 18:58.320
Please have mercy.

18:59.240 --> 19:01.800
-Please have mercy.
-Give her 20 lashes. Let's go.

19:12.440 --> 19:14.840
A-CHOU

20:21.880 --> 20:23.040
That sickly consumptive woman

20:23.640 --> 20:25.040
does nothing
but bring me bad luck every day!

20:25.640 --> 20:26.920
She's made me lose every last coin again!

20:28.680 --> 20:30.440
Stop coughing! Hold it in!

20:32.000 --> 20:33.000
Get out!

20:34.120 --> 20:35.680
You ungrateful little wretch!

20:35.760 --> 20:37.640
How dare you raise a hand
against your own father?

20:37.720 --> 20:39.480
You'll be struck by lightning one day!

20:51.760 --> 20:53.480
A-Chou, you're back.

21:00.200 --> 21:03.680
Don't mind your father.

21:05.920 --> 21:08.880
Once he's had too much to drink,
he stops acting human.

21:13.640 --> 21:14.760
What happened?

21:18.000 --> 21:19.400
What's happened to you?

21:19.480 --> 21:20.520
You're covered in wounds.

21:20.600 --> 21:21.880
Who did this to you?

21:23.040 --> 21:23.880
Ma,

21:25.640 --> 21:26.760
I hate this so much.

21:29.680 --> 21:32.760
We were born never knowing
a full belly or warm clothes.

21:34.120 --> 21:36.440
We sleep at midnight and rise before dawn,

21:40.360 --> 21:42.880
go door to door collecting swill,

21:43.400 --> 21:47.080
scrub chamber pots, and wash clothes
until our hands split open.

21:48.400 --> 21:50.880
Why should we have to live like this?

21:55.080 --> 21:56.280
It's my fault.

21:57.440 --> 22:00.360
I brought you
into a family trapped in such misery.

22:01.880 --> 22:06.000
My good girl,
who can refuse the fate they're born into?

22:06.080 --> 22:07.720
I refuse!

22:09.120 --> 22:12.400
Ma, I'm not some lowly pig or dog.

22:12.480 --> 22:13.960
I'm a human being.

22:19.480 --> 22:20.800
Just wait and see.

22:23.440 --> 22:25.920
I won't spend my whole life
as mud beneath people's feet.

22:26.000 --> 22:28.960
If Heaven gives me
so much as a single vine,

22:29.040 --> 22:33.720
I'll cling to it with everything I have
and climb upward no matter what it takes.

22:35.640 --> 22:37.200
I'll get you treated

22:38.680 --> 22:41.920
and make sure my younger siblings
never go hungry or live in fear again.

22:44.560 --> 22:46.480
I'll live like a real human being.

22:55.440 --> 22:56.360
ZHAO

22:56.440 --> 22:57.600
The Hutuo have invaded again,

22:57.680 --> 22:59.040
but with Lord Lu commanding our forces,

22:59.120 --> 23:00.160
we'll surely crush the enemy!

23:02.680 --> 23:05.240
Victory! Victory!

23:05.320 --> 23:06.560
Victory!

23:06.640 --> 23:08.080
Victory!

23:08.160 --> 23:09.280
Victory!

23:09.360 --> 23:10.520
Victory!

23:10.600 --> 23:13.120
Knowing how you feel,

23:13.200 --> 23:15.080
the Dowager Lady made an exception
and let you see him off.

23:15.680 --> 23:17.600
When Lord Lu sees you,

23:17.680 --> 23:19.880
he'll surely be overjoyed.

23:21.880 --> 23:25.000
TRIUMPH TAVERN

23:28.360 --> 23:29.960
Lord Lu will be victorious!

23:39.120 --> 23:39.960
What are you looking at?

23:41.120 --> 23:43.600
A vile shrew. Pay her no mind.

23:46.520 --> 23:52.640
Victory!

23:52.720 --> 23:53.800
Outside the Eldest Princess's
Residence that day,

23:53.880 --> 23:55.240
he could hardly bear to say goodbye.

23:56.320 --> 23:58.560
He promised me he'd come to our residence

23:58.640 --> 23:59.920
to propose once
he returned to the capital.

24:01.400 --> 24:03.000
That's wonderful news!

24:03.080 --> 24:06.480
The Dowager Lady has been eagerly awaiting
this day for so long.

24:06.560 --> 24:09.560
I'd better hurry back and tell her,

24:09.640 --> 24:12.200
Lady Guo, and Lady Heng'e.

24:12.280 --> 24:15.160
We need to start preparing
for the wedding.

24:15.240 --> 24:16.400
Indeed.

24:17.880 --> 24:20.640
I'll wait here in the capital
for Lord Lu to return

24:21.720 --> 24:23.600
so we can finally be married.

24:24.120 --> 24:25.800
HENGCHENG GATE

24:31.960 --> 24:33.080
Lu Zhuo,

24:33.880 --> 24:35.160
you have no choice.

24:38.960 --> 24:41.640
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE,
TWO MONTHS LATER

24:41.720 --> 24:43.120
WEI RAO'S DOWRY LIST

24:43.200 --> 24:44.840
GOLD, LANDS

24:44.920 --> 24:46.280
CALLIGRAPHY AND PAINTINGS,
SCROLLS, GOLD BRACELETS AND RINGS

24:58.400 --> 25:02.080
Massaging this Hegu Point
is good for your eyes.

25:02.160 --> 25:03.680
I know you're a devoted granddaughter.

25:03.760 --> 25:04.400
OLD MADAM WEI, MATRIARCH,
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

25:04.480 --> 25:06.480
Whenever my glaucoma flares up,

25:06.560 --> 25:08.080
I get terrible headaches,

25:08.920 --> 25:12.080
and everything becomes a blur.

25:12.600 --> 25:14.240
But over the past month,

25:14.320 --> 25:17.520
the pork liver and cangshu congee
you've been sending me

25:17.600 --> 25:18.240
WEI CHAN
OLD MADAM WEI'S THIRD GRANDDAUGHTER

25:18.320 --> 25:20.480
has helped a great deal.

25:24.600 --> 25:27.400
Mother, these bowls and fruit plates

25:27.480 --> 25:30.120
have such distinctive designs.

25:30.200 --> 25:31.560
Your recommendation was excellent.

25:32.160 --> 25:34.040
Silversmith Zhang's craftsmanship

25:34.720 --> 25:36.440
certainly lives up to its reputation.

25:36.520 --> 25:38.320
Ever since the girls were born,

25:38.400 --> 25:43.760
we've been setting aside
clothes, bedding, and dowries for them.

25:43.840 --> 25:47.000
Yesterday, I had the treasury opened
and drew up the dowry list.

25:47.080 --> 25:51.120
I've always had a soft spot for Rao.

25:51.200 --> 25:53.320
I simply couldn't bear to see her go,

25:54.160 --> 25:56.920
so I took the liberty of
adding a few more things.

25:57.000 --> 26:00.960
That makes 128 loads of dowry in total.

26:01.040 --> 26:03.000
Good. Very good.

26:04.600 --> 26:08.480
Heng'e, take a look
and see if anything's missing.

26:12.000 --> 26:14.240
You're always so thorough, Yufeng.

26:14.320 --> 26:16.920
This list couldn't be more complete.

26:31.200 --> 26:35.200
Rao, look at what I've prepared for you.

26:36.480 --> 26:37.320
Do you like it?

26:39.840 --> 26:41.680
What a beautiful necklace!

26:41.760 --> 26:44.520
I've been searching for two years
and haven't found one of this quality.

26:45.520 --> 26:46.880
Aunt Heng'e, why not give it to me?

26:48.880 --> 26:50.480
Fine jewels for a beautiful lady.

26:52.760 --> 26:55.080
Come. Let me put it on you.

26:59.200 --> 27:02.480
They suit you perfectly. Beautiful.

27:03.440 --> 27:04.920
Aunt Heng'e, you're so biased.

27:05.000 --> 27:08.000
What? Is Rao your only niece,

27:08.080 --> 27:09.960
and I'm just someone
you found on the street?

27:10.520 --> 27:12.800
Chan, mind your manners.

27:12.880 --> 27:14.760
How can you compare yourself to Rao?

27:14.840 --> 27:16.880
She's had so little love from her parents.

27:16.960 --> 27:19.600
Naturally, I tend
to favor her a little more.

27:19.680 --> 27:21.760
When it's your turn to get married,

27:21.840 --> 27:24.200
I'll have something special for you too.

27:25.960 --> 27:26.840
Chan.

27:28.760 --> 27:30.760
You're her older cousin.

27:30.840 --> 27:33.520
Instead of showing your younger cousin
some love and consideration,

27:33.600 --> 27:36.200
you're getting jealous over a gift.

27:36.280 --> 27:40.680
How can you be so petty
and show so little sisterly affection?

27:40.760 --> 27:43.480
Write out Lessons for Women ten times!

27:48.240 --> 27:50.760
I wouldn't dare give away
a gift from Aunt Heng'e.

27:50.840 --> 27:52.480
I have another fine necklace in my room.

27:53.280 --> 27:55.200
I'll have someone send it to you
this afternoon.

27:55.720 --> 27:57.080
Please don't upset Grandmother.

27:58.120 --> 28:00.080
Who needs you pretending to be nice?

28:01.200 --> 28:03.440
You're all so biased it's beyond belief!

28:04.040 --> 28:05.360
I don't want your necklace!

28:06.120 --> 28:07.240
Chan!

28:08.320 --> 28:10.160
She's so childish.

28:11.920 --> 28:14.240
Rao, don't take it to heart.

28:15.240 --> 28:16.680
Pay her no mind.

28:16.760 --> 28:18.360
As long as I'm here,

28:18.440 --> 28:20.560
I'll see to it that you
have a lavish dowry

28:20.640 --> 28:24.280
and marry into the Lu family
in grand style.

28:24.920 --> 28:25.920
Thank you, Grandmother.

28:29.240 --> 28:30.360
I'll go find Chan.

28:37.400 --> 28:39.960
Rao is certainly the more sensible one.

28:41.280 --> 28:43.720
Those two girls quarrel
every time they meet.

28:44.320 --> 28:46.080
I really don't know what to do with them.

28:46.800 --> 28:48.480
They're actually very close.

28:48.560 --> 28:50.600
LOTUS ROOM

28:50.680 --> 28:53.680
Dowager Lady, the army has returned
from its campaign against the Hutuo.

28:53.760 --> 28:54.680
Is it?

28:54.760 --> 28:57.120
-Did we win or lose?
-We won! A great victory!

28:58.960 --> 29:00.040
-Wonderful!
-Excellent!

29:00.120 --> 29:01.400
-Congratulations, Dowager Lady!
-What wonderful news!

29:01.480 --> 29:02.320
Wonderful!

29:02.960 --> 29:04.440
Congratulations, Mother.

29:04.520 --> 29:07.280
His Majesty will surely reward
Lu Zhuo handsomely.

29:07.360 --> 29:08.600
We won the battle,

29:08.680 --> 29:11.440
but I've heard people
around the capital saying

29:11.520 --> 29:14.360
that Lord Lu may not survive.

29:15.160 --> 29:16.360
What?

29:18.120 --> 29:20.160
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

29:20.240 --> 29:21.760
GENTLE AS A SOFT BREEZE

29:25.400 --> 29:27.320
Within two weeks of reaching the frontier,

29:27.840 --> 29:29.880
Lu Zhuo drove the main Hutuo army
back north.

29:30.400 --> 29:33.960
That night, he led 3,000 cavalrymen
in a raid on the enemy camp.

29:34.480 --> 29:37.760
But somehow, the Hutuo had been tipped off
and laid a trap in advance.

29:37.840 --> 29:39.080
DUKE OF YING

29:39.160 --> 29:40.120
We fought desperately to break through,

29:40.200 --> 29:43.480
DUCHESS OF YING

29:45.120 --> 29:46.640
suffering heavy casualties.

30:04.080 --> 30:04.960
Lu Zhuo!

30:15.760 --> 30:18.600
Lu Zhuo was struck by a poisoned arrow.

30:19.440 --> 30:21.400
Despite his injuries,
he charged into the enemy ranks

30:21.920 --> 30:24.120
and
beheaded the Hutuo's Left Wudu Marquis,

30:24.200 --> 30:25.960
Xiahou Xian.

30:27.120 --> 30:28.520
Our commander was gravely wounded,

30:28.600 --> 30:29.920
but the Hutuo were thrown into disarray.

30:30.760 --> 30:32.000
Our troops' morale soared,

30:32.080 --> 30:33.560
and we pressed home our advantage.

30:33.640 --> 30:35.400
The Hutuo have surrendered
and sought imperial recognition,

30:36.520 --> 30:38.160
but my dear friend…

30:41.920 --> 30:43.240
Quick! The medicine!

30:53.280 --> 30:55.600
Physician Zhang, my son…

30:55.680 --> 30:56.600
-Madam!
-Stay calm.

30:56.680 --> 30:57.640
You're Lu Zhuo's mother.

30:58.240 --> 30:59.600
Everyone in this household
is watching you.

31:00.120 --> 31:01.080
You mustn't lose your composure.

31:02.080 --> 31:02.920
Physician Zhang,

31:03.000 --> 31:07.520
you once served as a military physician
and have dealt with the Hutuo for decades.

31:07.600 --> 31:09.480
I believe you're the only one
who can save Lu Zhuo.

31:09.560 --> 31:10.880
HE WANNIANG,
WIFE OF THE DUKE OF YING'S ELDEST SON

31:10.960 --> 31:13.400
Tell me honestly. Can he still be saved?

31:13.480 --> 31:14.800
Your Grace,

31:14.880 --> 31:17.560
this is a poison
the Hutuo use for hunting.

31:18.160 --> 31:19.720
Lord Lu has fought alongside you
since he was 12.

31:19.800 --> 31:21.680
He should have known how dangerous it was.

31:21.760 --> 31:23.560
He should have returned
to the capital immediately

31:23.640 --> 31:25.840
to have the arrow removed,
the infected flesh cut away,

31:25.920 --> 31:27.200
and the poisoned blood drained
with needles.

31:27.280 --> 31:28.600
Then he might have survived.

31:28.680 --> 31:30.520
But he returned far too late.

31:33.400 --> 31:35.920
I'm afraid
his chances of survival are slim.

31:52.600 --> 31:55.880
Zhuo can still be saved.

31:56.840 --> 31:58.280
I'll pray to the gods

31:58.960 --> 32:02.720
and kneel at all 180 temples
in the capital.

32:03.800 --> 32:08.400
Even if I have to try
every remedy there is,

32:10.240 --> 32:12.760
I'll find a way to save him!

32:19.120 --> 32:20.280
BEARING THE SUN'S RADIANCE

32:20.360 --> 32:23.160
Mother was just instructing
the servants to prepare gifts

32:23.240 --> 32:26.160
so she could visit you at your residence.

32:26.240 --> 32:29.120
But unexpectedly,
you've come to see us first.

32:29.200 --> 32:30.800
You didn't even send word ahead,

32:30.880 --> 32:34.040
or we would have arranged
a proper welcome.

32:36.600 --> 32:38.480
Our families have been close
for generations.

32:39.080 --> 32:41.440
Once our two children are married,

32:42.120 --> 32:43.880
we'll practically be one family.

32:43.960 --> 32:46.280
Why bother with such formalities?

32:48.000 --> 32:54.000
My dear, I've taken the liberty
of coming here today for one reason alone.

32:54.080 --> 32:56.880
It's about their marriage.

33:13.920 --> 33:16.320
Our families had an understanding

33:16.400 --> 33:19.480
that once Lu Zhuo returned victorious,
we would hold the wedding.

33:19.560 --> 33:21.360
I've already chosen an auspicious date.

33:21.440 --> 33:24.240
The 12th day of the fifth month.

33:25.040 --> 33:27.160
That's only five days away.

33:27.240 --> 33:31.680
Your Grace, isn't that rather rushed?

33:31.760 --> 33:32.880
Indeed.

33:32.960 --> 33:34.200
For families of our standing,

33:34.280 --> 33:40.600
preparing a girl for marriage
can take three to five years.

33:41.120 --> 33:46.920
My dear, there's no need to pretend
you don't understand.

33:48.480 --> 33:50.520
Wei Rao can afford to wait,

33:51.440 --> 33:53.200
but my grandson cannot.

33:53.800 --> 33:56.920
Lu Zhuo was wounded in battle
and is now bedridden.

33:57.000 --> 34:00.240
The priest from Zhaotai Shrine
told me himself

34:00.320 --> 34:02.760
that Wei Rao has an auspicious destiny

34:02.840 --> 34:04.000
and is blessed
with both fortune and wisdom.

34:04.080 --> 34:06.880
If she marries him to bring him
good fortune,

34:06.960 --> 34:09.159
Lu Zhuo will surely pull through.

34:09.960 --> 34:13.199
The wedding date
was also chosen by the priest himself.

34:13.800 --> 34:16.719
Let me make you a promise today.

34:16.800 --> 34:18.679
As long as Wei Rao agrees to marry him,

34:18.760 --> 34:20.280
whether Lu Zhuo wakes up or not,

34:20.360 --> 34:23.320
our family will forever
be indebted to her.

34:23.400 --> 34:27.080
If my grandson isn't fortunate enough
to have such a blessed wife,

34:27.159 --> 34:30.280
she may choose
any other young man in the Lu family

34:30.360 --> 34:31.719
and marry whichever one she wishes.

34:32.760 --> 34:34.679
If she insists on leaving the Lu family,

34:34.760 --> 34:38.719
I'll give her an additional 10,000 liang
for her dowry so she can remarry.

34:42.080 --> 34:43.480
I understand now.

34:44.639 --> 34:49.280
The Duke of Ying's family
has loyally served our nation.

34:49.880 --> 34:53.040
Lu Zhuo is a hero wounded in battle.

34:53.760 --> 34:57.880
What I'm about to say may offend you,

34:58.600 --> 35:00.440
but I have to say it.

35:00.960 --> 35:05.960
Lu Zhuo is gravely ill,
and no treatment has worked.

35:06.040 --> 35:08.960
Everyone in the capital knows it.

35:09.040 --> 35:13.800
This granddaughter of mine
lost her father as a child.

35:13.880 --> 35:20.720
And now you're forcing her
to bear the stigma of widowhood so young.

35:20.800 --> 35:23.960
You're practically sending her
to her death!

35:24.040 --> 35:25.600
Mother, please calm down.

35:25.680 --> 35:29.240
There are ways to put this more tactfully.

35:29.320 --> 35:32.760
We shouldn't
damage the bond between our families.

35:32.840 --> 35:35.480
I don't care about that now.

35:36.560 --> 35:39.080
Your eldest grandson may be precious,

35:39.600 --> 35:43.560
but that doesn't make
my granddaughter expendable.

35:44.320 --> 35:49.040
Back then, I had to bury my own son.

35:49.600 --> 35:54.080
And now, you expect my granddaughter
to marry Lu Zhuo

35:54.160 --> 35:55.680
in hopes of curing him?

35:56.960 --> 35:58.760
LOTUS ROOM

35:59.760 --> 36:01.640
I simply cannot agree.

36:02.240 --> 36:08.280
You lost your son,
and that was a terrible tragedy.

36:09.280 --> 36:12.600
But three of my four sons died,
and the remaining one was left disabled.

36:12.680 --> 36:14.320
Who can I turn to with my grief?

36:15.520 --> 36:17.880
I blame neither Heaven nor anyone else.

36:17.960 --> 36:20.360
Such is the fate of the men in my family.

36:21.000 --> 36:25.000
But Lu Zhuo
fought for our country and its people.

36:25.080 --> 36:27.400
Without his courage on the front lines,

36:27.480 --> 36:30.000
would your family enjoy peace
and prosperity today?

36:32.120 --> 36:34.120
To save my grandson's life,

36:34.640 --> 36:36.400
even if I have to use
my family's influence,

36:36.480 --> 36:39.280
I'll make sure your granddaughter's
bridal carriage enters our gates!

36:39.800 --> 36:41.600
If there's any retribution,

36:41.680 --> 36:43.360
even if I must endure thousands of cuts,

36:43.440 --> 36:45.400
I'll bear it alone.

36:49.760 --> 36:51.560
As for this marriage,

36:52.880 --> 36:58.000
Old Madam Wei,
you have no choice but to agree to it.

37:00.400 --> 37:01.280
Reporting!

37:03.160 --> 37:04.320
An attendant from Changle Palace

37:04.400 --> 37:05.360
has arrived with an edict
from the Empress Dowager.

37:24.720 --> 37:26.280
Open the main gates.

37:26.880 --> 37:28.320
Set up the incense table.

37:28.920 --> 37:33.960
Follow me
to receive the Empress Dowager's edict.

37:44.400 --> 37:45.360
Well.

37:45.440 --> 37:47.240
Rao, checking out your dowry?

37:48.840 --> 37:50.640
Lady Chan, you can't just barge in.

37:51.320 --> 37:54.520
-Lady Chan…
-Can't I have a word with my cousin?

37:59.920 --> 38:01.800
All these jade ornaments
and gold bracelets,

38:02.520 --> 38:04.160
yet you may never get to wear any of them.

38:05.040 --> 38:08.440
Traditionally,
a widow mourning her husband

38:08.520 --> 38:11.920
must wear the coarsest hemp clothing

38:12.520 --> 38:13.600
for three years.

38:14.640 --> 38:16.040
Take my advice.

38:16.120 --> 38:18.720
Pack plenty of coarse hemp
for your wedding,

38:18.800 --> 38:21.520
so you won't be caught unprepared.

38:21.600 --> 38:22.440
What did you say?

38:25.480 --> 38:27.680
Don't tell me
you still haven't heard, Rao.

38:28.800 --> 38:30.600
Lu Zhuo's injuries are beyond treatment.

38:30.680 --> 38:32.000
He's at death's door.

38:32.520 --> 38:36.400
Your bridal carriage may have barely
entered his residence

38:36.480 --> 38:39.400
before you find yourself a widow.

38:41.160 --> 38:43.320
You pretend to be so dutiful and proper,

38:43.400 --> 38:46.040
but you abuse your maids and commit
all sorts of vile acts.

38:46.680 --> 38:48.440
Only Grandmother falls for your act.

38:50.400 --> 38:52.200
Like mother, like daughter.

38:52.280 --> 38:53.280
Just look at you.

38:53.360 --> 38:55.480
You were born to bring misfortune
to your husband,

38:55.560 --> 38:56.560
just like your birth mother.

38:57.240 --> 38:59.240
As if brought death upon Second Uncle
weren't enough,

39:00.120 --> 39:02.640
she shamelessly chased wealth and status.

39:03.160 --> 39:05.600
A vulgar woman through and through.

39:10.640 --> 39:12.280
I never turned on you before

39:13.680 --> 39:15.520
because you were still useful to me.

39:17.040 --> 39:19.400
But you crossed me first this time.

39:22.400 --> 39:23.560
What are you going to do?

39:30.040 --> 39:31.480
Go get Grandmother and Mother!

39:31.560 --> 39:33.440
-Show them her true colors!
-Yes.

39:40.160 --> 39:43.880
She's trying to kill me! Murderer!

39:43.960 --> 39:45.200
BEGONIA COURT

39:45.280 --> 39:46.480
Mother, don't worry.

39:46.560 --> 39:48.360
-Sisters bicker all the time.
-Hurry!

39:48.440 --> 39:50.320
-Let's hurry.
-It's nothing serious.

39:57.240 --> 39:58.520
Grandmother!

39:58.600 --> 39:59.800
What happened?

39:59.880 --> 40:02.120
Grandmother!

40:02.200 --> 40:03.840
Wei Rao's gone mad!

40:03.920 --> 40:06.800
She's trying to kill your granddaughter!

40:06.880 --> 40:08.440
What's gotten into you two?

40:10.560 --> 40:12.000
Someone help!

40:12.080 --> 40:13.880
-Help!
-Help!

40:14.880 --> 40:16.040
My Lady…

40:17.200 --> 40:19.160
-Someone, please!
-Get in here and save her!

40:19.240 --> 40:20.640
Get her down!

40:23.200 --> 40:24.040
What are you doing?

40:24.120 --> 40:26.080
Get her down! Hurry!

40:26.160 --> 40:27.480
Lower her! This is terrible!

40:27.560 --> 40:29.520
Quick! Get her down!

40:29.600 --> 40:30.640
Are you all right?

40:32.560 --> 40:35.000
Rao, what were you thinking?

40:35.080 --> 40:35.920
You foolish child.

40:37.160 --> 40:38.040
What are you waiting for?

40:38.120 --> 40:40.560
-Go get some water! Hurry!
-Yes.

40:40.640 --> 40:41.760
Here, drink slowly.

40:42.280 --> 40:43.320
Have some water first.

40:45.920 --> 40:47.240
You foolish girl.

40:47.320 --> 40:49.320
What on earth has happened to you?

40:49.400 --> 40:51.160
You could have told me.

40:51.680 --> 40:53.160
I could have sought justice for you,

40:53.920 --> 40:56.880
and your grandmother
could have helped you!

40:56.960 --> 41:00.800
Why would you resort
to taking your own life?

41:04.880 --> 41:05.720
Ma,

41:06.600 --> 41:08.680
I only came to comfort her.

41:08.760 --> 41:10.680
But when she heard she had to marry
into the Lu family,

41:10.760 --> 41:11.800
she suddenly turned on me

41:11.880 --> 41:13.360
and started hitting and cursing me
like a madwoman.

41:13.440 --> 41:14.960
I'm her older cousin!

41:16.160 --> 41:17.160
Grandmother!

41:21.480 --> 41:22.600
Kneel.

41:23.360 --> 41:24.560
Get on your knees!

41:25.080 --> 41:26.520
You thoughtless girl.

41:26.600 --> 41:29.360
Your grandmother kept it from her
to protect the family.

41:29.440 --> 41:31.360
How dare you blurt it out and upset her?

41:32.360 --> 41:36.080
How utterly reckless and foolish!

41:36.800 --> 41:38.720
You've caused so much trouble.

41:38.800 --> 41:40.040
Hurry up and apologize.

41:41.080 --> 41:43.160
Look what she did to me!

41:44.160 --> 41:46.000
She's always putting on an act,
pretending to be innocent,

41:46.080 --> 41:47.800
and you all fall for it!

41:47.880 --> 41:50.680
-Every single time, you take her side!
-Enough!

41:52.240 --> 41:55.080
Go and kneel in the ancestral hall
for three days and nights.

41:55.960 --> 41:57.680
No one is to bring her food!

41:57.760 --> 41:58.760
Yes.

42:04.480 --> 42:05.720
Everyone, leave us!

42:15.800 --> 42:18.360
Rao… Rao…

42:20.160 --> 42:21.560
Grandmother,

42:22.120 --> 42:24.920
I've been ill-fated since childhood,

42:26.560 --> 42:29.880
with no parents to love me
and no brothers to rely on.

42:29.960 --> 42:32.960
I've survived this long
only because of you.

42:33.040 --> 42:37.160
But Lu Zhuo is already at death's door.

42:37.240 --> 42:39.040
If I marry him, I'll end up a widow.

42:40.120 --> 42:41.560
People may start saying that
the women of the Wei family

42:41.640 --> 42:43.040
bring death to their husbands,

42:43.920 --> 42:46.360
which will tarnish our family's name
and my cousins' reputations.

42:47.160 --> 42:50.120
I… I'd be better off dead!

42:50.200 --> 42:52.600
Rao! Rao…

42:53.800 --> 42:54.840
Rao…

42:58.440 --> 42:59.280
Ma,

42:59.360 --> 43:03.240
my second brother loved Rao more than
anyone when he was alive.

43:03.320 --> 43:05.160
She's his only child.

43:06.160 --> 43:09.080
What does it matter
how noble the Lu family is?

43:09.960 --> 43:10.960
If they want to be heroes,

43:11.040 --> 43:12.680
let them do it themselves!

43:12.760 --> 43:15.120
Why drag innocent Rao into this?

43:16.200 --> 43:17.720
Besides,

43:17.800 --> 43:21.160
Rao's birth mother
already has such a reputation…

43:21.240 --> 43:22.840
You be quiet too!

43:24.080 --> 43:25.480
Never mention that woman to me again!

43:31.040 --> 43:33.400
If I had any other choice,

43:35.160 --> 43:39.320
do you think I'd sacrifice Rao?

43:41.000 --> 43:44.800
But the Duke's family
has outmaneuvered us.

43:45.720 --> 43:48.360
They've secured an edict
from the Empress Dowager.

43:50.120 --> 43:52.600
Do you expect me to openly defy it

43:52.680 --> 43:55.920
and send our entire family
to the scaffold?

43:59.680 --> 44:01.520
An edict from the Empress Dowager?

44:06.280 --> 44:09.600
Rao, for the sake of our household

44:10.320 --> 44:12.840
and the safety of the entire Wei family,

44:14.960 --> 44:20.480
you should forget you ever had me
as your grandmother!

44:24.200 --> 44:25.040
Ma…

44:29.000 --> 44:30.160
Grandmother…

44:30.240 --> 44:32.400
Ma, please save Rao!

44:33.040 --> 44:35.160
Grandmother!

44:35.240 --> 44:36.880
Ma!

44:43.200 --> 44:44.520
I can't count on Grandmother anymore.

44:46.560 --> 44:50.040
Aunt Heng'e,
you've always cared for me the most.

44:51.200 --> 44:52.400
Will you help me?

44:53.560 --> 44:54.720
How?

45:06.600 --> 45:09.520
Aunt Heng'e, I don't want to be a widow.

45:19.800 --> 45:20.640
Rao,

45:23.880 --> 45:24.760
don't worry.

45:24.840 --> 45:27.080
Even if I have to search
the entire capital,

45:28.280 --> 45:32.680
I'll find someone to marry in your place.

47:49.200 --> 47:51.960
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
